      "id": "claim_851967450de045a29aca1aa5580a2419",
      "statement": "Development is trunk-based with release tags: main is the verified production state that only moves forward after a milestone is validated in production, release tags (e.g. v0.3, v0.4) snapshot validated releases for pinning or rolling back a deployment, and there is no CI pipeline — changes are validated in the local regression test environment and in production runs before integration (the only GitHub workflow is the scheduled wiki refresh).",
