    {
      "id": "claim_019e9cb1103a4b9faaeb958038c14afe",
      "statement": "Daemon configuration is layered as code defaults -> apps/.env -> BC_* environment variables -> the SQLite Settings table: config.load_env() loads apps/.env into os.environ with override=False (already-exported values win, shared with the batch entry point), BC_* variables (BC_DATA_DIR, BC_DB_DIR, BC_DB_FILE, BC_LOG_DIR, BC_BROWSER_DIR, BC_PROFILE_ROOT, BC_DOWNLOAD_DIR) override the daemon's filesystem paths (primarily so tests avoid touching production apps/ data), and db.get_setting() returns a stored Settings row if present, otherwise the value from config.DEFAULT_SETTINGS (e.g. pause_deadline_seconds 1800, max_concurrency 1, display_start 99, display_count 16, git_commit_enabled false, ui_base_url, ntfy_topic, download_dir, vnc_password empty for localhost-only noVNC).",
